> The madness of the 2012 NBA Draft, from Dion Waiters' rise to Kentucky's historic six-man draft class.
As always, the NBA Draft started at breakneck speed. Commissioner David Stern came out[ from behind] his[ al]mighty Oz curtain and was greeted as he has been for years — with aggressive booing from the Prudential Center crowd.
